      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Libqalculate</title>

    <para>Prepare Libqalculate for compilation:</para>

      <para>Now Configure the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static \
  --docdir=/usr/share/doc/libqalculate-&libqalculate-version;
</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">make
</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">make DESTDIR=${DESTDIR} install
</userinput></screen>

        <screen><userinput remap="post">${YBLD}/ydest-strip-x64.sh;
rm -v /usr/lib/libqalculate.la
</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

